<h2>Setting it up</h2>

<p>
  Enter your email on the <a href="<%= login_path %>">sign-in page</a> and
  Remindly sends you a link — there is no password to choose. The first time you
  sign in it asks one question, whether you are setting this up for someone else
  or will be receiving the reminders yourself, and takes you straight in.
</p>

<p>
  The <a href="<%= how_to_path %>">guide</a> walks through creating a first
  reminder, and the <a href="<%= faq_path %>">questions page</a> covers the rest
  — including the things Remindly deliberately does not do. If you would rather
  describe your situation to a person first, email
  <a href="mailto:hello@remindly.care">hello@remindly.care</a>: if this is the
  wrong fit for what you need, you will be told so.
</p>

